==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features {{p|Rotom}} in its {{form|Rotom|Frost Rotom}} form.
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Ultra Prism|Frost Rotom|41}} from the {{TCG|Ultra Prism}} expansion.
*{{m|Blizzard}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Rotom|Frost Rotom}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

